# Optional software ("Extras"): the installer's Extras page (branding
# notesqml.qml) and `aedwen-extras` read this file. One line per package group:
#
#   id|kind|packages (space separated)
#
# kind `local`:  already part of the ISO image. The installer removes the
#                group when its id was not ticked.
# kind `online`: not on the image. Installed from the repositories when ticked
#                (during the install if there is a network, or later with
#                `aedwen-extras install <id>`).
# An id can have both kinds (e.g. a language: the runtime is on the image, the
# language server and package managers are downloaded).
# The ids match branding/aedwenos/notesqml.qml. This file is not under
# /etc/calamares because the installer deletes that directory before it
# applies the choices.

# --- developer tools
dev-core|local|base-devel git github-cli gdb strace ripgrep fd tmux
python|local|uv
python|online|python-pip python-pipx pyright
javascript|local|nodejs npm
javascript|online|pnpm typescript typescript-language-server

# --- editors (Zed and Neovim are native; Code - OSS is an Electron app)
zed|online|zed
neovim|online|neovim
helix|online|helix
vscode|online|code

